OL,3,GNEWSACouncil removes dozens of 'tatty'
OL,4,Alamppost flags
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicestershire County Council has
OL,7,Fremoved dozens of Union and St George
OL,8,Fflags from lampposts because they were
OL,9,Funsafe or in a "very poor condition".
OL,11,FHighways officials told the BBC they
OL,12,Fhad taken down 159 flags across the
OL,13,Fcounty in the year since people started
OL,14,Fattaching them to street lights as part
OL,15,Fof the Operation Raise the Colours
OL,16,Fmovement in the summer of 2025.
OL,18,FThe authority said it asked people not
OL,19,Fto put flags on street furniture "for
OL,20,Fsafety reasons".
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
