OL,3,GNEWSACouncil removes dozens of 'tatty'
OL,4,Alamppost flags
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour MP for Loughborough Jeevun
OL,7,FSandher, who previously urged the
OL,8,FReform UK-led council to remove flags,
OL,9,Fsaid he did not want to see them
OL,10,F"hanging tattily" from lampposts.
